Find all quadratic functions $f(x) = ax^2 + bx + c$ from the set of real numbers to the set of real numbers for which the graph of $y = f(x)$ has no x-intercepts, and for which the equation
\[f(x) = 0\cdot x,\]for all real numbers $x \in \mathbb{R}$ is satisfied.
